        "description": {
            "value": "<p>In addition to the initiate benefits, when you hold your lantern, its light reveals the invisible and the ethereal. The lantern's aura of light increases to a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30]. While you're holding your lantern, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Invisible] and ethereal creatures within the aura become visible as rippling distortions, though they're still @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed]. This doesn't give you any special ability to affect a creature on the Ethereal Plane, but it ensures you're aware of the creatures' presence.</p>"
